         "html": "pANDEMICS"
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "html": "<em>The Spanish flu and COVID-19 have striking similarities when it comes to the dissemination of false information. During the Spanish flu fortune telling became widespread, while during COVID-19, we obtain information from arbitrary sources on the internet. History has an interesting way of repeating itself through new mediums.</em>"
