         "tag": "h5",
         "html": "FILTER THROUGH HISTORY"
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "html": "<em>When going to art museums, many find it difficult to understand and appreciate historical art. Face filters can act as a modern medium to teach about historical art movements and styles.&nbsp;</em><em><br><br></em><em>Top left: Expressionism&nbsp;</em><em><br></em><em>Top right: Cubism</em><em><br></em><em>Bottom left: Surrealism</em><em><br></em><em>Bottom right: Pop art</em>"
        }
